{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x2c4fc9",
      "back_en": "Hic... *sob*... Father...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente; onomatopeia mantida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c504e",
      "back_en": "you were... fine, and...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Perde 'just' e a gagueira 'f-fine'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c509c",
      "back_en": "as you always do...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c50ad",
      "back_en": "Why? Why...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Idêntico."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5115",
      "back_en": "Your Highness. We should return.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c51d1",
      "back_en": "Oshtor... Wh-What is to become of me...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel, gagueira mantida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c51fa",
      "back_en": "Without... Without Father, I...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5306",
      "back_en": "to see you in such a sorry state.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c538c",
      "back_en": "for a long time yet.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c53d2",
      "back_en": "I cannot. I can't. It's just i-impossible...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5464",
      "back_en": "Vurai--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Idêntico."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c54c8",
      "back_en": "his strength.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c551c",
      "back_en": "What is that...thing?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Estrutura espelha o original."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5562",
      "back_en": "in arms, careless of who sees...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'her' implícito; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c55b5",
      "back_en": "should inherit the throne.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c55fb",
      "back_en": "herself?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5630",
      "back_en": "my Mikado?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c56a5",
      "back_en": "But it is not this helpless, weeping child.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c56d1",
      "back_en": "What are you doing? Stand up.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c571c",
      "back_en": "kneel before you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c572e",
      "back_en": "If you are unable to do even that much, I...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5787",
      "back_en": "And Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c57fa",
      "back_en": "court is secure from here on.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'surely' omitido, sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c584c",
      "back_en": "I, however...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c58c2",
      "back_en": "one who licks the shoes of a false empress.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'pretender'~'falsa', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c590a",
      "back_en": "Lord Woshis, the Mikado's autopsy is complete.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5939",
      "back_en": "I see. Thank you for informing me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5a25",
      "back_en": "And? Did they find anything?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5a8a",
      "back_en": "Poison... I see.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5afe",
      "back_en": "killed him.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5beb",
      "back_en": "Lady Honoka. Where is Lady Honoka right now?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5d0d",
      "back_en": "But I have heard reports of Lady Honoka and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5d3b",
      "back_en": "Lord Oshtor speaking in secret recently",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5d6d",
      "back_en": "Lord Oshtor!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5d7b",
      "back_en": "It is unlikely, but perhaps Lady Honoka and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5da9",
      "back_en": "Lord Oshtor conspired to a--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5ea0",
      "back_en": "liberty of searching Lord Oshtor's chambers...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5fbf",
      "back_en": "That would mean--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5fd1",
      "back_en": "No... No, that's impossible. Oshtor and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Lord' omitido, leve."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6064",
      "back_en": "folly...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c606d",
      "back_en": "It's possible that their 'loyalty' was an",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Gagueira 'I-It's' não reproduzida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c609b",
      "back_en": "act, in order to secure an opportuni--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c60cc",
      "back_en": "B-But with this much evidence...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel, gagueira mantida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c60ed",
      "back_en": "I wish not to overstep my bounds, but... did someone",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Reestruturado, sentido ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c611c",
      "back_en": "else not think Oshtor's rise to power",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c614c",
      "back_en": "incredibly fast?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'oddly'=estranhamente, não 'incrivelmente'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6158",
      "back_en": "Perhaps some machination in the court allowed",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6188",
      "back_en": "him to--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6191",
      "back_en": "Now that you mention it, Oshtor has spoken",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c61c3",
      "back_en": "out against the Mikado before. He opposed the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c61f3",
      "back_en": "war!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6254",
      "back_en": "Oshtor... and that harlot. I understand they are",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6287",
      "back_en": "responsible for this transgression.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c63ee",
      "back_en": "attempting to frame Lord Oshtor and Lady Honoka.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Erro: 'incriminare' (deveria 'incriminar')."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6491",
      "back_en": "killed our liege!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c64ee",
      "back_en": "Anju continues clinging to Oshtor desperately,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c654e",
      "back_en": "Oshtor... P-Please, do not leave me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6573",
      "back_en": "I bid you... N-No, I wish you to stay by my side",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c65af",
      "back_en": "Rest assured that I, Oshtor, will remain your",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c65df",
      "back_en": "most loyal retainer forevermore.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6600",
      "back_en": "Y-You will (stay)? Truly? Promise me, Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Vai ficar' explicita o sentido, ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6629",
      "back_en": "Give me your word.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6655",
      "back_en": "Lord Oshtor. Was it really you...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6678",
      "back_en": "Oshtor will pay for his sins.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6698",
      "back_en": "He'll pay with his life.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c67fd",
      "back_en": "Oshtor... Y-You are right, of course.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6851",
      "back_en": "rule over Yamato as he would have wanted me to.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c696e",
      "back_en": "Lord Oshtor instructed me to brew some for you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c69c3",
      "back_en": "Oshtor...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6a23",
      "back_en": "That's right. I am no longer alone. Oshtor",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6a6b",
      "back_en": "So long as he remains with me, I can surmount",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6b4f",
      "back_en": "An herbal tea from Oshtor, eh?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6c90",
      "back_en": "You may enter! Come in! How I've missed you, Oshtor,",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Really, Oshtor' virou 'Que saudade'; muda sentido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6cea",
      "back_en": "I was told Your Highness summoned me at",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Reestruturado, sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6d95",
      "back_en": "...You do not recall?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6dab",
      "back_en": "Since you're here, I wanted to tell you",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'express'~'dizer', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6dfd",
      "back_en": "Tea? What tea is this?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6e14",
      "back_en": "The herbal tea you sent me, Osh--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6e38",
      "back_en": "*cough*--the--*cough, cough*",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6e64",
      "back_en": "*cough, cough*--M-My throat, it--*cough*",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6e8d",
      "back_en": "Your Highness!? Speak to me!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6eaa",
      "back_en": "S-So hot... my throat, burning...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6f15",
      "back_en": "Osh... tor...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6f24",
      "back_en": "Your Highness!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6f48",
      "back_en": "Ghhkk--!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6f81",
      "back_en": "needs an apothecary immediately!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6fa2",
      "back_en": "H-Hah, ha... hah... Hnngh--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia adaptada."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c700a",
      "back_en": "Pardon my impertinence. What happened?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7031",
      "back_en": "Hah, hah, h-hah--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia adaptada."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7043",
      "back_en": "Wh--Your Highness!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7056",
      "back_en": "What is going on!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7079",
      "back_en": "Lord Oshtor. I must ask that you step away",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c70b9",
      "back_en": "I am sure you wish to defend yourself, but I ask",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c70ec",
      "back_en": "that you make this easy for us both and comply.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c711c",
      "back_en": "...I understand.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c712d",
      "back_en": "Oshtor quietly steps away from Anju's",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7155",
      "back_en": "pain-wracked form, and Woshis takes his place",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7381",
      "back_en": "Please... Please take Lord Oshtor into custody.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'à prisão'~custódia, ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c73ff",
      "back_en": "order once more.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7472",
      "back_en": "But... treat him respectfully as long as he",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c74a0",
      "back_en": "puts up no resistance.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c74c5",
      "back_en": "Still not quite grasping what's going on, the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c74f5",
      "back_en": "soldiers step behind Oshtor and take him by",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c752d",
      "back_en": "...I have only one thing to ask of you (pl).",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7742",
      "back_en": "...Lord Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c785e",
      "back_en": "I can only assume the same poison was used to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c788e",
      "back_en": "render Her Highness in such a state...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c78b5",
      "back_en": "Have you anything to say in your defense?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c78df",
      "back_en": "I swear upon my oath to our liege that I would",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c797b",
      "back_en": "You mustn't! This area is off-limits--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7a91",
      "back_en": "Vurai...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7aa1",
      "back_en": "Lord Vurai!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7ab5",
      "back_en": "To think that the only man to ever make me",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7ae2",
      "back_en": "the one who tasted defeat would sink so low...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Coerente com a frase anterior."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7b57",
      "back_en": "I would dirty my fist by even consenting to strike you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'deigning'~'consentir', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c7bbe",
      "back_en": "Take Lord Oshtor to the dungeons.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5358",
      "back_en": "me...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c535e",
      "back_en": "I th-thought I wouldn't succeed him s-so",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido com a continuação."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5440",
      "back_en": "a nearby hallway settles upon them.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5532",
      "back_en": "That whelp, weeping and whimpering to Oshtor...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'filhote' como pejorativo aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c581c",
      "back_en": "You'll be free to flatter at will.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'her' omitido, sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c58f2",
      "back_en": "Yatanawarabe Shyasurika",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Nome próprio."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5cc5",
      "back_en": "last person who would...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5e07",
      "back_en": "M-My deepest apologies.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c5e74",
      "back_en": "W-With these findings in mind, I took the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6000",
      "back_en": "Lady Honoka are more loyal to our liege than",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'liege' deixado em inglês; traduzir (soberano)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6355",
      "back_en": "Please, Lord Vurai, calm yourself.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c6378",
      "back_en": "This poison... seems too convenient,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'too perfect'~'conveniente demais', aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c64cf",
      "back_en": "You mustn't use violence here!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2c65a6",
      "back_en": "forever.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
